{"articleNo":"362106","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=362106&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [근로]2022년 1학기 국가근로장학금 추가신청기간 안내[5.2(월)~5.9(월)]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.04.19","hit":"21787","attachments":[{"name":"2022년 1학기 국가근로장학금 일반유형(추가) 학생신청 매뉴얼.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=362106&attachNo=111232"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">[2022년&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">국가근로장학금 추가신청기간 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"></span><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1. 목적 : 국가근로장학금 일반유형 추가신청기간을 마련하여 1,2차 통합신청기간 중 </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">장학금 미신청자 구제</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- 해당 기간에 신청한 학생은 국가근로장학금 일반유형(일반교내, 일반교외) 및 하계방학집중근로 프로그램(추후 희망근로지 신청 필수)&nbsp;참여 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;: 2022. 5. 2.(월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">) 09:00 ~ 2022. 5. 9.(월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">시까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;: 2022년 1학기 국가근로장학금 일반유형 근로를 희망하는 학생</span><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;- 자격요건 : </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">해당학기(2022년 1학기) 학자금 지원구간이 산정된 학생</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">*에 한하여 추가 신청 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">*해당 학기 국가장학금 신청, 국가근로장학금 미신청 상태로 학자금 지원구간이 기 산정되어있는 경우</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">한국장학재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(www.kosaf.go.kr)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">및 모바일앱을 이용하여 학생신청</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">★ 첨부파일 매뉴얼 반드시 숙지.</span></b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(시스템&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">☎&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">한국장학재단 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1599-2290)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- 2022년 1학기 </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학자금 지원구간이 산정된 학생</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">만 신청가능</span></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- 기존 국가근로장학금 통합신청 기간 내 신청자 신청</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> 불가능</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 국가근로장학금 일반유형(추가) 학생신청 매뉴얼 1부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"16581\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"user\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2022-04-19T13:57:35.976Z\",\n\"md\": \"2022-04-19T13:57:35.997Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\